  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요.&#160;임용&#160;첫해&#160;재과만에서&#160;많은&#160;도움을&#160;받았습니다^ㅁ^ <br>신규&#160;교사분들께&#160;도움이&#160;되길&#160;바라는&#160;마음으로&#160;수업&#160;자료&#160;올려봅니다&#160;ㅎ.ㅎ <br>학습지는&#160;김신연(경기)&#160;선생님께서&#160;올려주신&#160;활동지&#160;사용했습니다! <br><br><br>* 다운이 안되거나 문제/수정 사항이 있으면 알려주세요 ㅠ.ㅠ<br>* 3단원은 유료 템플릿을 구매하여 제작해서 ㅠ 수정을 제한(읽기 전용)하여 공유합니다.ㅠㅠㅠ<br><br><br>&lt;학습지&#160;링크&gt; <br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1291\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1291</a><br><br>&#160;<br><br>&lt;수업&#160;자료&#160;링크&gt; <br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NEFce7vMb2Nwkfvx1FzvcA-hdMbqql8i?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NEFce7vMb2Nwkfvx1FzvcA-hdMbqql8i?usp=sharing</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e4154d4c538b4c4f8ea9e2607275b6a011062ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e4154d4c538b4c4f8ea9e2607275b6a011062ef\" data-origin-width=\"1766\" data-origin-height=\"803\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f72e0ddbefd915157cec1649e384db2a487e01b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f72e0ddbefd915157cec1649e384db2a487e01b\" data-origin-width=\"1760\" data-origin-height=\"798\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a32199c91d958bd9d1b13c02e0cb5f96936ba2f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a32199c91d958bd9d1b13c02e0cb5f96936ba2f5\" data-origin-width=\"1757\" data-origin-height=\"577\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"fig